      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, waiting on your own is extremely dangerous because kidney stones can lead to permanent kidney damage or life-threatening infections very quickly. Pain medication alone will not resolve a potential blockage or infection, and delaying care could turn a manageable situation into a surgical emergency. Please do not try to avoid medical help; contacting a doctor's office immediately or going to the emergency room is the safest and most responsible option for your health.",
